    "subtitle": "Series 1: Episode 1",
    "synopses": {
     "large": "Puzzle setter John ‘Ludwig’ Taylor’s life of solitude is upended when his identical twin, DCI James Taylor, disappears. Drafted in by his sister-in-law Lucy, John reluctantly assumes his brother's identity as a detective in the Cambridge Police Authority in order to find clues to his brother’s whereabouts. \n\nJohn is tasked with infiltrating the major investigations team, gathering information and solving a completely unconnected murder, all whilst remaining in character as his brother. A difficult ask for anyone, let alone a reclusive puzzle-setting genius who rarely leaves the house. Can this master of all things cryptic crack his biggest puzzle yet?",
     "small": "Puzzle setter John ‘Ludwig’ Taylor’s life is upended when his identical twin disappears.",
     "medium": "Puzzle setter John ‘Ludwig’ Taylor’s life is upended when his identical twin, DCI James Taylor, disappears. John reluctantly assumes his identity in order to track him down.",
     "editorial": "The accidental detective. Puzzle master John is plunged into the cryptic world of crime",
     "programme_small": "Puzzle setter John ‘Ludwig’ Taylor assumes his twin brother's identity to track him down."
